  "body": "Deadline sale: Closes on Monday 14 December 2026 at 3:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nDiscover modern living at its best with these beautifully designed, brand-new homes in the heart of Browns Bay. Offering contemporary style, spacious interiors and quality finishes, these homes are perfect for families looking for comfort, convenience and excellent school zoning.\r\n\r\nChoose the home that suits your lifestyle:\r\n\r\nLot 1\r\n• 164m² freehold land\r\n• 175.6m² floor area\r\n• 4 bedrooms, 3.5 bathrooms\r\n• Single internal-access garage\r\n\r\nLot 2 & Lot 3\r\n• 129m² freehold land each\r\n• 173.3m² floor area each\r\n• 3 bedrooms plus study, 3.5 bathrooms\r\n• Single internal-access garage\r\n\r\nEnjoy high ceilings, a modern kitchen, spacious open-plan living and dining, stylish interiors and seamless indoor-outdoor flow to your private entertaining deck.\r\n\r\nExcellent School Zones\r\nZoned for the highly sought-after Rangitoto College, as well as Murrays Bay Intermediate, Northcross Intermediate and Sherwood School.\r\n\r\nConvenient Browns Bay Lifestyle\r\nEnjoy easy access to Browns Bay Beach, local shops, cafés, restaurants, parks and reserves. Everything you need is close by, making everyday living effortless.\r\n\r\nWhether you’re upsizing, buying your first family home or securing a quality investment, this is an opportunity not to be missed.\r\n\r\nBrand new. Freehold. Premium school zone. Your next move starts here!",
